---
/**
 * The site-wide identity backdrop.
 *
 * Mounted exactly ONCE per layout — never inside a section. It is a single
 * fixed layer sitting behind everything:
 *
 *     image.png                        (the brand texture)
 *       ↓
 *     theme-dependent veil             (light or dark translucent wash)
 *       ↓
 *     existing ambient gradients       (body::before, z -2)
 *       ↓
 *     page content                     (z 1)
 *
 * The layer is inert: `aria-hidden` plus `pointer-events: none`, so it never
 * intercepts a click, a selection or the keyboard. Styling lives in
 * global.css next to the other design tokens.
 */
---

<div class="kb-backdrop" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="kb-backdrop__image"></div>
  <div class="kb-backdrop__veil"></div>
</div>
